      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "frost_gudny_moved_told",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“A mile in, and they shifted the whole of it in one winter. My grandmother's winter.” She goes back to the trough. “Ask the factor for the why. There is no why in the ledger, I have looked, and a thing with no why in a ledger is a thing somebody decided not to write down.”"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
